| Go client â†’ C server: Read | ðŸ”² Ready | Test implemented |
| Go client â†’ C server: GetVariableAccessAttributes | ðŸ”² Ready | Test implemented |
| Go client â†’ C server: Write | ðŸ“‹ Planned | Not yet implemented |
| Go client â†’ C server: InformationReport | ðŸ“‹ Planned | Not yet implemented |
| Go client â†’ C server: File services | ðŸ“‹ Planned | Not yet implemented |
| Go server â†’ C client | ðŸ“‹ Planned | Not yet implemented |

## Prerequisites

- Go 1.22+
- GCC or Clang
- CMake 3.10+

## Quick start

1. Clone and build the full libIEC61850:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/mz-automation/libIEC61850.git /tmp/libIEC61850
   cd /tmp/libIEC61850 && mkdir -p build && cd build && cmake .. && make
   ```

2. Start the C server:
   ```bash
   ./interop/start_c_server.sh
   ```

3. Run interop tests:
