- [`_examples/`](_examples/) â€” runnable client and server examples
- [`COMPLIANCE.md`](COMPLIANCE.md) â€” service support matrix with test coverage
- [`ERRORS.md`](ERRORS.md) â€” error taxonomy and handling guide
- [pkg.go.dev](https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/otfabric/go-mms) â€” API reference

